==== Flash Layout ====
<WRAP 60em lo>
If booting from primary partition, **mtd6** will be named ''ubi'', with **mtd8** as ''ubi'' if booting from alternate partition\\
</WRAP>


^  <color #508CAA>Layer 0</color>  |  //raw flash//\\ 256 MiB  ||||||||||
^  <color #508CAA>Layer 1</color>  |  **mtd0**\\ ''u-boot''\\ 2 MiB  |  **mtd1**\\ ''u_env''\\ 128 KiB  |  **mtd2**\\ ''s_env''\\ 256 KiB  |  **mtd3**\\ ''unused_area''\\ 5888KB  |  **mtd4**\\ ''devinfo''\\ 256KB  |  //firmware//\\ 246 MiB  ||||  **mtd9**\\ ''BBT''\\ 1 MiB  |
^  <color #508CAA>Layer 2</color>  |:::|:::|:::|:::|:::|  **mtd5**\\ ''kernel1''\\ 123 MiB  ||  **mtd7**\\ ''kernel2''\\ 123 MiB  ||:::|
^  <color #508CAA>Layer 3</color>  |:::|:::|:::|:::|:::|  //primary//\\ //kernel image//\\ 3 MiB  |  **mtd6**\\ ''rootfs1 (ubi)''\\ 120 MiB  |  //alternate//\\ //kernel image//\\ 3 MiB  |  **mtd8**\\ ''rootfs2 (ubi)''\\ 120 MiB  |:::|
